  "body": "Who's ready for postseason baseball?!\r\n\r\n## Added\r\n\r\n- Add Wildcard standings view to the Standings tab. Thanks @tjweir!: [PR 152](https://github.com/mlb-rs/mlbt/pull/152)\r\n- Add elimination numbers and clinch status to the Standings tab: [PR 155](https://github.com/mlb-rs/mlbt/pull/155)\r\n- Add postseason stats to player pages: [PR 156](https://github.com/mlb-rs/mlbt/pull/156)\r\n\r\n## Changed\r\n\r\n- Use qualified stats as the default in the Stats tab: [PR 153](https://github.com/mlb-rs/mlbt/pull/153)\r\n\r\n\r\n**Full Changelog**: https://github.com/mlb-rs/mlbt/compare/v0.5.0...v0.6.0",
